readme=p/'README.md';readme.write_text('''# Nekketsu Legends HD v0.6.3 Alpha — Kits and Agility\n\n**This is an independent HTML5 game engine, not an NES emulator or Nintendo ROM.** It is unfinished, including original-game parity, licensing, portraits, exact rosters, formations, flag/crest artwork and multiplayer networking.\n\n## Newly implemented\n\n- Each of the 216 built-in teams has two distinct procedurally colored **home/away uniform variants**. Pre-match selection on both sides, preview and match rendering use the actual choice. Choice persists via browser storage. Colors are original game art and are not verified real-world licensed kits.\n- A separate, editable **Agility** rating is added to all players; RUN/speed governs top speed, Agility governs acceleration, stopping and change of direction for human- and AI-controlled players. Ratings preserve old roster data by deriving defaults.\n- New RUN / AGI ratings show in Squad Management and Agility progresses in career training for midfielders and forwards.\n- Extensive future **Player Creator** requirements entered as item 105–124 in the backlog. See docs below. No pretense that all faces, haircuts and reserved star portraits exist today.\n\n## Run and test\n\nOpen `play.html` for standalone offline play (Chromium tested) or host the modular folder using `python -m http.server 8080` and visit `http://localhost:8080`. Run `npm test`, `npm run qa` and `npm run build`; existing Python Playwright and a Chromium executable are required for browser tests. Save/export features work through local browser storage.\n\n## Key documents\n\n- `docs/NEXT_MILESTONES.md`: living roadmap.\n- `docs/FEATURE_MATRIX_124_ITEMS.csv`: all 124 requirements and precise status.\n- `docs/PLAYER_CREATOR_SPEC_v063.md`: 20 face templates, 20 hairstyles, 10 beard/mustache styles, body type, 155–210 cm height, exclusive famous-star face design requirements.\n- `docs/TEST_REPORT_v063.md`, `docs/CHANGELOG_v063.md`: tested scope and remaining limitations.\n- `src/kits.js`, `src/stats.js`, `src/engine.js`: implementation.\n\n**Next** remains v0.7.0 team flags/crests, formations, captains, substitution and tactical command center.\n''')
